  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Liberia Engineering &amp; Geo-Tech Village Electrification Off-Grid Energy Challenge Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Liberia Engineering &amp; Geo-Tech Consultants Company is currently providing electricity at a small scale to 13 households using a fuel based generator in the town of Totota; central Bong County. This project expands these activities by constructing a stand-alone PV 25 KW solar plant to serve 50 households through a mini grid; for which households will pay a small monthly fee based on metered usage of electricity.</narrative>
  </description>
